  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This Greek lemon chicken serves 4 and needs just 15 minutes of preparation before spending 55 minutes in the oven. Bone-in chicken thighs roast on a bed of potatoes with lemon, garlic and herbs until the skin is golden and the potatoes have soaked up all the cooking juices."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use bone-in, skin-on thighs for the best result. The bones carry flavour into the roasting juices and the skin protects the meat while it cooks, keeping it moist. Boneless thighs will work but will need 10 fewer minutes in the oven."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
